---
// Short intro paragraph immediately after the hero. Reinforces the brand name
// "Inside Prosper" so brand search queries can match clear on-page text.
---

<section class="bg-bg py-16 lg:py-20">
  <div class="mx-auto max-w-3xl px-6 text-center">
    <h2 class="font-heading text-3xl font-extrabold tracking-tight text-text sm:text-4xl">
      What is <span class="font-display italic text-primary">Inside Prosper</span>?
    </h2>
    <div class="mt-6 space-y-4 text-base leading-relaxed text-text-muted sm:text-lg">
      <p>
        <strong class="text-text">Inside Prosper</strong> is where neighbors discover the local businesses that make this town special — restaurants, shops, trades, fitness studios, and the people behind them.
      </p>
      <p>
        Every business on Inside Prosper earned its spot through a real conversation, not a payment. Curated and invitation-only — no pay-to-play, no sponsored rankings, no filler. Just the businesses Prosper neighbors genuinely recommend.
      </p>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>
